statement:
Let n, N, p ∈ ℕ, M ⊆ ℝ^N, θ : ℝ^N → ℝ, f : ℝ^N → ℝ^p, ψ : ℝⁿ → ℝ^N and u ∈ ℝⁿ. Put x := ψ(u), A := fderiv ℝ ψ u, T := range A and B := fderiv ℝ (f∘ψ) u. Assume:
- θ(x) ≠ 0;
- HasWeightedApproximateTangentSpaceAt n M θ x T;
- HasLineDerivAt ℝ f (B w) x (A w) for every w ∈ ℝⁿ.

Then:
(i) approxTangentPlane n M θ x = T;
(ii) there is a continuous linear L : T → ℝ^p with HasTangentialDifferentialAt T f x L;
(iii) areaJacobian (approxTangentPlane n M θ x) f x · normDet(A) = normDet(B).
